{"help": "https://data.vietnam.opendevelopmentmekong.net/api/3/action/help_show?name=package_show", "success": true, "result": {"notes_translated": {"vi": "\u0110\u1ec3 \u1ee9ng ph\u00f3 v\u1edbi s\u1ef1 l\u00e2y lan c\u1ee7a d\u1ecbch b\u1ec7nh covid-19, ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7 vi\u1ec7t nam \u0111\u00e3 tr\u01b0ng d\u1ee5ng m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 n\u01a1i \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e1ch ly nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 d\u1ea5u hi\u1ec7u ho\u1eb7c ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac v\u1edbi c\u00e1c b\u1ec7nh nh\u00e2n m\u1eafc b\u1ec7nh. B\u1ed9 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u n\u00e0y cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin v\u1ec1 n\u01a1i c\u00e1ch ly v\u00e0 c\u00e1c b\u1ec7nh vi\u1ec7n \u0111i\u1ec1u tr\u1ecb covid-19.", "en": "In response to the spread of the covid-19 epidemic, the Vietnamese government has requisitioned several places to isolate people showing signs or contact with infected patients. This data set provides information on isolation areas and covid-19 treatment hospitals in Vietnam."}, "MD_Format_version": {"vi": "", "en": ""}, "maintainer": null, "author": null, "CI_Citation_title": {"vi": "C\u00e1c khu c\u00e1ch ly v\u00e0 b\u1ec7nh vi\u1ec7n \u0111i\u1ec1u tr\u1ecb COVID-19 t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam", "en": "COVID-19 quarantine areas and treatment hospitals in Vietnam"}, "MD_DataIdentification_topicCategory": ["Health care policy and administration", "Public health"], "taxonomy": ["Health care policy and administration", "Public health"], "MD_Metadata_dateStamp": "2020-05-08T09:59:34.421496", "EX_TemporalExtent_startDate": "", "maintainer_email": null, "num_tags": 2, "odm_copyright": "Yes", "CI_Citation_updateFreq": "continual", "CI_ResponsibleParty_contact": {"vi": "", "en": ""}, "EX_GeographicBoundingBox_east": "", "DQ_PositionalAccuracy": {"vi": "", "en": ""}, "id": "b7b95a98-4b2e-44ae-9aaa-69d199f24091", "metadata_created": "2020-04-28T08:50:07.179981", "title_translated": {"vi": "C\u00e1c khu c\u00e1ch ly v\u00e0 b\u1ec7nh vi\u1ec7n \u0111i\u1ec1u tr\u1ecb COVID-19 t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec